{"body": "This fixes issue w/ broken Gradle build due to quite older version of shadow plugin which is incompatible w/ Gradle 5 so that when we\n./gradlew clean build\nwe get\nFAILURE: Build failed with an exception.\n* What went wrong:\nMethod com/github/jengelman/gradle/plugins/shadow/internal/DependencyFileCollection.getBuildDependencies()Lorg/gradle/api/tasks/TaskDependency; is abstract", "date": "2019-04-08T19:04:27Z", "hash": "sha256:b1ecaa09f4aabb05991b", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#151", "meta": {"additions": 1, "base": "master", "closed_at": "2019-04-09T00:17:39Z", "comments": 6, "deletions": 1, "draft": false, "files": ["build.gradle"], "merged_at": "2019-04-09T00:17:39Z", "merged_by": "rdblue", "n_files": 1, "number": 151, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "state": "merged", "thumbs_up": 0, "updated_at": "2019-04-09T00:17:39Z"}, "people": ["fbocse"], "refs": [], "source": "github", "title": "[MINOR] Fix broken gradle build because of older shadow plugin version incompatible w/ gradle 5", "type": "pr", "url": "https://github.com/apache/iceberg/pull/151"}
{"body": "This applies the Baseline plugins for the iceberg-common project.\nAdditionally, there was an error in how we applied the Baseline plugin to iceberg-api in the first place. The manner in which we applied the plugin appeared to make the plugin not actually take effect at all. This PR significantly changes the way we apply Baseline in order to get the right behavior. Now:\n\n./gradlew check depends on all the linting tasks\nAdded the Spotless plugin, which is what would normally be used by com.palantir.baseline-format, but we change the formatting rules to put static imports after non-static imports. Now, one can also run ./gradlew spotlessApply to automatically some classes of formatting errors.\nApplies all of the Baseline plugins manually, rather than applying the blanket baseline plugin - this is to opt-out of the baseline-format plugin.", "date": "2019-04-09T18:19:55Z", "hash": "sha256:ede3d9a4d97f8c549255", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#152", "meta": {"additions": 140, "base": "master", "closed_at": "2019-04-10T16:10:08Z", "comments": 2, "deletions": 81, "draft": false, "files": ["api/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/io/CloseableIterable.java", "api/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/transforms/Timestamps.java", "api/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/transforms/TestTimestamps.java", "build.gradle", "common/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/common/DynClasses.java", "common/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/common/DynConstructors.java", "common/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/common/DynFields.java", "common/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/common/DynMethods.java"], "merged_at": "2019-04-10T16:10:08Z", "merged_by": "rdblue", "n_files": 8, "number": 152, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "reviews": [{"at": "2019-04-09T18:21:01Z", "by": "mccheah", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2019-04-10T16:05:32Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2019-04-10T16:07:11Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}], "state": "merged", "thumbs_up": 0, "updated_at": "2019-04-10T16:10:09Z"}, "people": ["mccheah"], "refs": [], "source": "github", "title": "Applies Baseline to iceberg-common and fixes applying Baseline to Iceberg-api", "type": "pr", "url": "https://github.com/apache/iceberg/pull/152"}
{"body": "Fixes linting errors caused by applying Baseline to iceberg-core.\nCloses #154.\nThe major update is that Baseline is opinionated against using Guava caches. We replace them with Caffeine caches everywhere. See palantir/gradle-baseline#317 for some reasoning about this.\nOtherwise, the style guidelines are consistent with how Baseline is applied in iceberg-api and iceberg-common.", "date": "2019-04-10T01:37:09Z", "hash": "sha256:192d0dd01802a89af72a", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#153", "meta": {"additions": 1191, "base": "master", "closed_at": "2019-05-07T23:47:30Z", "closes": [154], "comments": 44, "deletions": 1137, "draft": false, "files": ["build.gradle", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/BaseMetastoreTableOperations.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/BaseMetastoreTables.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/BaseSnapshot.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/BaseTableScan.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/BaseTransaction.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/ConfigProperties.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/DataFiles.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/FileHistory.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/FilteredManifest.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/GenericDataFile.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/GenericManifestFile.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/GenericPartitionFieldSummary.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/LocationProviders.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/ManifestEntry.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/ManifestGroup.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/ManifestReader.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/ManifestWriter.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/MergingSnapshotUpdate.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/PartitionData.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/PartitionSpecParser.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/PropertiesUpdate.java"